            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most apartments, a 120V compact dryer around 2.6 cu ft, such as the Magic Chef MCSDRY15W or BLACK+DECKER BCED26, is the best fit. It plugs into a standard outlet, pairs well with a 1.6 cu ft portable washer and fits in a closet. You will still need a way to vent it outdoors, usually a window vent kit, and ideally a dedicated circuit."
